\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPzJNgka0_UQ7kNvwH8RPaY&_nc_oc=Admg5oCsrdmWHGU0z00wq-cjDslyKNm7x4y_6l1xB7RRtK5qeGBOqczqFI3AWKKe-uA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzzUh1MbLKZ5WmWbDjk4hiWO717LyZMvJLq1Q4DoB8LSA&oe=69B3F374"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1AnCGn_wOsQ7kNvwG8y1HD&_nc_oc=AdlyoVbgqMkWNIC3Tv9LrBXvJb5DZT37d7hm0nX92GqJZ0QplSDRuXJLEgFdQ7GOP5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfztfuVeW-SeQG_jM35EBeGYf9F6asv7ECt-P-9FhpRdRg&oe=69B3F4D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7N2FdbbMHl8Q7kNvwHm3uDG&_nc_oc=AdlDA-BRPnrAxHgyYTFZ6gNAygh3Kb11NsM09Yrdz6qw26frkzGWsE8zNLZpUVsw05Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxUxaKv97NWN6rzrfdxamJhfYx6Lv9BpocnuBvAgLu2jA&oe=69B409F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771